+<body>
+  <header class="wrap topbar">
+    <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Merge Conflict team home"><span class="brand-mark">M</span><span>MERGE CONFLICT</span></a>
+    <nav class="nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
+      <a href="#team">The humans</a>
+      <a href="#future-of-se">The future</a>
+    </nav>
+    <button id="theme-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Switch to night mode" aria-pressed="false"><span aria-hidden="true">☾</span><span>Night mode</span></button>
+  </header>
+
+  <main id="top">
+    <div class="wrap hero">
+      <div>
+        <p class="eyebrow">Five brains · one shared repo · several snack opinions</p>
+        <h1>Meet the humans behind the <span class="highlight">merge.</span></h1>
+        <p class="hero-copy">We’re five first-semester Computer Science master’s students at Paderborn University. We like building things, asking better questions, and checking whether the “obvious fix” has quietly deleted production.</p>
+        <p class="hero-copy"><strong>Our team superpower:</strong> a healthy suspicion of confident answers—whether they come from a chatbot, a compiler, or someone saying “quick refactor.”</p>
+      </div>
+      <div class="hero-sticker" aria-label="Five teammates, zero trust in unreviewed code">
+        <span class="spark one" aria-hidden="true">✳</span>
+        <div><strong>5 → 1</strong><span>teamwork, shared tabs &amp; one suspiciously large group chat</span></div>
+        <span class="spark two" aria-hidden="true">✦</span>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+
+    <div class="ticker"><p>Now compiling: ideas · questions · a very thorough code review&nbsp; ✳ &nbsp;Now compiling: ideas · questions · a very thorough code review</p></div>
+
+    <section class="wrap" id="team" aria-labelledby="team-title">
+      <div class="section-heading">
+        <div><p class="section-kicker">Meet the committers</p><h2 id="team-title">Good at different things. United by the diff.</h2></div>
+        <p>Five people, five specialties, and enough hot takes to keep the pull request discussion lively.</p>
+      </div>
+      <div class="team-grid">
+        <article class="member-card">
+          <div class="portrait-wrap"><img src="{{image:gouthami.png}}" alt="Photo of Gouthami"><span class="number-tag">01</span></div>
+          <div class="card-body">
+            <div class="name-row"><h3>Gouthami</h3><span class="role">Data &amp; details</span></div>
+            <p>M.Sc. Computer Science · Paderborn University</p>
+            <div class="detail"><span class="detail-label">Into</span><p>Data visualisation, dancing and baking (the cakes are in beta).</p></div>
+            <div class="detail"><span class="detail-label">Fun fact</span><p>Supermarket labels taught her more German than German class. Brot: the original flashcard.</p></div>
+            <blockquote class="hot-take"><span class="detail-label">Hot take</span>If you can’t explain the code AI wrote, you didn’t build it—you copied a guess.</blockquote>
+          </div>
+        </article>
+
+        <article class="member-card">
+          <div class="portrait-wrap"><img src="{{image:chirag.png}}" alt="Photo of Chirag"><span class="number-tag">02</span></div>
+          <div class="card-body">
+            <div class="name-row"><h3>Chirag</h3><span class="role">ML &amp; match day</span></div>
+            <p>M.Sc. Computer Science · Paderborn University</p>
+            <div class="detail"><span class="detail-label">Into</span><p>Machine learning, cricket and locating Paderborn’s best Döner.</p></div>
+            <div class="detail"><span class="detail-label">Fun fact</span><p>His German Döner rating list is longer than his thesis-idea list. Priorities: well seasoned.</p></div>
+            <blockquote class="hot-take"><span class="detail-label">Hot take</span>“Prompt engineering” is just writing clear requirements—and we were always bad at that.</blockquote>
+          </div>
+        </article>
+
+        <article class="member-card">
+          <div class="portrait-wrap"><img src="{{image:krish.png}}" alt="Photo of Krish"><span class="number-tag">03</span></div>
+          <div class="card-body">
+            <div class="name-row"><h3>Krish</h3><span class="role">Web &amp; keys</span></div>
+            <p>M.Sc. Computer Science · Paderborn University</p>
+            <div class="detail"><span class="detail-label">Into</span><p>MERN-stack web development, chess and playing piano.</p></div>
+            <div class="detail"><span class="detail-label">Fun fact</span><p>About 2000 bullet-chess rating: making questionable moves at an elite speed.</p></div>
